            "detailed_description": "<strong>Hyperspace Invaders II: Pixel Edition</strong> is a hardcore, uncompromising vertical scrolling bullet hell/invader hell shooter (shmup) that doubles as a techno-based lightsynth, triggering bursts of funky invaders at the pulse of a relentless beat.<br><br><strong>HIII:PE</strong> also features an extra track/level by French flashcore artist <i>HFK</i>, pushing the engine to a gameplay tempo of 360BPM.<br><br>- <strong>Hardcore, uncompromising vertical scrolling bullet hell/invader hell action</strong>.<br>- <strong>Tempo-synced Gameplay</strong> (invader movement, bulletpatterns and more get triggered at the pulse of a beat)<br>- <strong>Adaptive Difficulty</strong> (harder as you play better)<br>- <strong>Generative Gameplay</strong> (never the same level twice)<br>- Dominate the <strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong> and unlock all the <strong>Achievements</strong>!<br>- <strong>Full Controller Support</strong> (+ Vibration) <br>- An <strong>OST of 10 tracks</strong> by renowned artists in the world of electronic music, such as: <i>Carl Finlow</i> / <i>Ronny Ragtroll</i> / <i>Karl Lihagen</i> / <i>Atomhead </i>/ <i>Subjex </i>/ <i>Zuvuya </i>/ <i>Mergel </i>/ <i>NoProblemCore </i>/ <i>Psykovsky </i>&amp; <i>Arcek </i>/ <i>HFK</i> and <i>WK(ES)</i>.<br><br><br>",
